 to the frame callback"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":180.0,"y":70.0,"w":300.0,"h":34.0,"text":"task · 220 ms","tone":"red","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"t","x":180.0,"y":116.0,"text":"input waits","size":10.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"k0","x":62.0,"y":70.0,"w":66.0,"h":34.0,"text":"50 ms","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"k1","x":140.0,"y":70.0,"w":66.0,"h":34.0,"text":"50 ms","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"k2","x":218.0,"y":70.0,"w":66.0,"h":34.0,"text":"50 ms","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"k3","x":296.0,"y":70.0,"w":66.0,"h":34.0,"text":"50 ms","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"t","x":180.0,"y":116.0,"text":"input and frames run between chunks","size":10.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"p0","x":66.0,"y":56.0,"w":104.0,"h":30.0,"text":"user-blocking","tone":"red","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"p1","x":180.0,"y":56.0,"w":104.0,"h":30.0,"text":"user-visible","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"p2","x":294.0,"y":56.0,"w":104.0,"h":30.0,"text":"background","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"w","x":180.0,"y":110.0,"w":160.0,"h":28.0,"text":"Worker: off-thread","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[8.9,29.4]}]},{"title":"Layout","sub":"Reflow and compositor","short":"Layout","main":"Read first, then write.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Layout thrashing","Read, then write","Compositor"],"captions":["Reading dimensions right after a write forces the browser to recalculate layout at once; in a loop this slows the page","Read everything first, then write everything; batch the changes into one frame","Animate transform and opacity: they run on the compositor; contain and content-visibility skip what is unseen"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":30.0,"lines":["for (const el of items) {","  el.style.width = a + 'px';","  h += el.offsetHeight;  // reflow","}"],"hl":[